WEBVTT

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.449
NN: I was selected
to be in the first wave

00:21:00.473 --> 00:21:02.179
of the Autism at Work program.

00:21:02.203 --> 00:21:05.328
AG: SAP's Autism at Work program
leverages the unique perspectives

00:21:05.352 --> 00:21:06.738
of people on the spectrum

00:21:06.762 --> 00:21:08.456
to foster innovation.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:09.776
Through the program,

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.540
Nico joined the accounts payable
department as an analyst.

00:21:12.564 --> 00:21:15.259
His job was to process
thousands of invoices a day.

00:21:15.966 --> 00:21:19.196
One day, Nico had an idea
to make the process more efficient,

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.806
an idea that would
put his coding skills to good use.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.668
He wanted to bring it to his manager,

00:21:24.692 --> 00:21:27.616
but he still felt nervous
navigating social situations.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.066
Thankfully, SAP had
a mentorship system in place